          "explanation": "The family gave fragmentary diagnostic wording that could have triggered deeper reconstruction.",
          "quote": "体位性什么心动过速"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by incomplete discharge context, but the doctor did not obtain and integrate a non-minimum hidden fact such as prior syncope history, exact episode circumstances, or detailed tilt/standing-test interpretation beyond the pending Holter issue.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
