          "explanation": "The doctor avoided over-treating fluids/salts as a substitute for pending rhythm review.",
          "quote": "不必猛灌盐水"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00091",
          "explanation": "The doctor maintained uncertainty about the Holter result rather than fabricating it.",
          "quote": "我还没在系统里看到报告"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 is met: the doctor did not fabricate a Holter result or claim cardiac risk was closed, and kept oral rehydration/hydration advice bounded.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
